{'symbol': 'AXON', 'date': '2021-10-12 07:30:00', 'title': 'AIR NATIONAL GUARD TO RENEW TASER DEVICE PROGRAM', 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ., OCT. 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 AXON (NASDAQ: AXON), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CONNECTED PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGIES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE AIR NATIONAL GUARD, THE RESERVE BRANCH OF THE U.S. AIR FORCE, WILL RENEW ITS TASER DEVICE PROGRAM AND DEPLOY ROUGHLY 5,000 TASER X26P ENERGY WEAPONS TO RESERVE TROOPS.'}